                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "do we still have any use case for stateless IP? If not we might want to drop it. We can always use link local address..."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/ncsi/files/gbmc-ncsi-br-deprecated-ips.sh.in",
                    "line": 72,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William A. Kennington III",
                        "email": "wak@google.com",
                        "username": "wak-google"
                    },
                    "message": "It may not be needed for neighbor entries but I'd like to make sure it's still working as it provides a nice fallback path to reach trays if they don't DHCP. I just kept it because it was already here and it's not hard to preserve."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/ncsi/files/gbmc-ncsi-ra.sh",
                    "line": 58,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
                        "email": "yuxiaozhang@google.com",
                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "nit: just check here RA_IF == NCSI_INFT, so you don't need to modify the script"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/ncsi/files/gbmc-ncsi-ra.sh",
                    "line": 58,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William A. Kennington III",
                        "email": "wak@google.com",
                        "username": "wak-google"
                    },
                    "message": "The issue is I no longer do substitution on this script, so I needed to push down the check to a script that had `@NCSI_INTF@`"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-google/recipes-google/ncsi/files/gbmc-ncsi-ra.sh",
                    "line": 58,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
